  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  LevyAll
  @  Everything about one point, tagged: CDF, PDF, CDFc, mean, deviation.
  @  Author & design           : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 3; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 3 ≠ THEN "LevyAll: needs 3 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → x0v scv Xv « x0v 0 + scv 0 + Xv 0 + → x0 sc X « 'IFTE(X≤x0;0;erfc(√(sc/(2*(X-x0)))))' →Num 'Kc' STO Kc "CDF" →Tag 'IFTE(X≤x0;0;√(sc/(2*Ⓒπ))*EXP(-sc/(2*(X-x0)))/((X-x0)^1.5))' →Num "PDF" →Tag 'IFTE(X≤x0;1;1-erfc(√(sc/(2*(X-x0)))))' →Num "CDFc" →Tag 'Ⓒ∞' →Num "μ" →Tag 'Ⓒ∞' →Num "sx" →Tag { Kc } PURGE x0v scv Xv 3 →List Drop » »
»
